<mxCell id="r2why" value="All other logs are 2022-11-10. Nov 11 date is a typo.&#xa;CEF: ts=2022-11-10T03:11:12Z  source=syslog  severity=INFO&#xa;session_key=(&quot;vagrant&quot;,&quot;10.0.2.2&quot;,&quot;k8s-core-master&quot;)&#xa;action=ssh_auth  event_type=ssh_auth" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="146" width="620" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
