<mxCell id="summary" value="Parsing summary:  Removed 1 (MonDB infra)  |  Corrected 1 (date typo Nov11→Nov10)  |  Renamed 2 event names  |  Precision-fixed 2 K8s rows  |  Dropped 1 field (fingerprint)&#xa;Output: 7 clean CEF events  |  4 sources: syslog, k8s, free5GC-NF, netflow  |  All timestamps ms-precise  |  session_key + txn_id extracted" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#3B6D11;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="466" width="1260" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
